{"version":1,"content":"<p>Rockstar旗下開放世界新作《GTA VI》在發售後的銷量持續攀升。此前有報道稱，該作在首發周末結束時銷量已接近4500萬份。儘管此後銷售速度有所放緩，但遊戲在Xbox Series和PlayStation 5兩大主機平台上的銷量仍在不斷累積。據Alinea Analytics最新估算，《GTA VI》的總銷量已經超過5300萬份。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1588324.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T08:03:53.303880+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":174,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T07:51:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T07:57:15.485452+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T07:57:15.485452+00:00","content_hash":"af2dddd502861bc3fad24b78c44bb9bc536e92ab8a27b07ea0f397837227918a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}